:{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/fileExporter(isPresented:documents:contentTypes:onCompletion:onCancellation:)-9vg2i":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/fileexporter(ispresented:documents:contenttypes:oncompletion:oncancellation:)-9vg2i","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/fileExporter(isPresented:documents:contentTypes:onCompletion:onCancellation:)-9vg2i","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fileExporter","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"isPresented","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Binding","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text"